---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ugrinovačka - Prvi Balkan" description="Lokacija Ugrinovačka - Prvi Balkan">
  
  <div class="pt-32 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Lokacija Ugrinovačka</h1>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Informacije</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Adresa</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Ugrinovačka 456, 11070 Beograd</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Telefon</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600"><a href="tel:+381112101111" class="hover:text-accent">+381 11 2101 111</a></p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Email</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600"><a href="mailto:ugrinova@prvi-balkan.rs" class="hover:text-accent">ugrinova@prvi-balkan.rs</a></p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2">Radno vreme</h3>
              <ul class="text-gray-600 space-y-1">
                <li>Ponedjeljak-Petak: 08:00 - 18:00</li>
                <li>Subota: 09:00 - 15:00</li>
                <li>Nedelja: Zatvoreno</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <a href="/kontakt" class="inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition">
              Zakaži pregled
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487754180143-c282803d6773?w=800&h=500&fit=crop" alt="Lokacija Ugrinovačka - Pregled vozila" class="w-full h-auto">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">O Ovoj Lokaciji</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Naša lokacija na Ugrinovoj Čuki je centralno pozicionirana i lako dostupna. Sa parking mjestima i modernom opremom, osiguravamo ugodno iskustvo dok čekate pregled vašeg vozila.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
